Third-party notices for the TermForms runtime
=============================================

The runtime (runtime/) is 0BSD. One part of it is derived from another's
data:

runtime/src/tui/tf_width_tables.c, the character width tables, is
generated by tools/gen_width_tables.py from the Unicode Character
Database (the East_Asian_Width property and the general categories, as
Python's unicodedata module carries them). The Unicode Character
Database is covered by the following notice.

Programs built with TermForms need not carry this notice: it is met by
appearing here, in the runtime's documentation (condition (b) below).

